        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The plans show the site of an airport now and how it will look after redevelopment next year. </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></span></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<p><strong>The plans show the site of an airport now and how it will look after redevelopment next year. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></p>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Airport Site Now vs After Redevelopment</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Đề b&agrave;i Airport Site Now vs After Redevelopment y&ecirc;u cầu th&iacute; sinh m&ocirc; tả bố cục hiện tại của Southwest Airport v&agrave; kế hoạch ph&aacute;t triển lại sẽ ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh v&agrave;o năm tới.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paraphrase đề Airport Site Now vs After Redevelopment với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Những thay đổi sẽ diễn ra trong Southwest Airport</li>\n<li>So s&aacute;nh bố cục từ hiện tại với sau khi ph&aacute;t triển.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh. Cụ thể với đề Airport Site Now vs After Redevelopment, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ n&oacute;i về những thay đổi sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZdNdn58xo1DePxzr3CldmTZgch\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">S&acirc;n bay sẽ trải qua <strong>qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể</strong> <em>(significant expansion</em>), với v<em>iệc tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i số cổng</em> <em>(more than twice the number of gates)</em> v&agrave; bổ sung nhiều tiện &iacute;ch mới.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZdNdn58xo1DePxzr3CldmTZgch\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Kh&ocirc;ng gian sẽ được biến đổi từ&nbsp;<strong>cấu h&igrave;nh đơn giản </strong><em>(simple configuration)</em> th&agrave;nh <strong>một hệ thống ga h&agrave;nh kh&aacute;ch phức tạp</strong> <em>(complex terminal system)</em> với <em>sky train</em> v&agrave; <em>shopping area</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i Airport Site Now vs After Redevelopment một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c chi tiết dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; về&nbsp;<strong>ph&acirc;n chia theo khu vực kh&ocirc;ng gian (spatial zones).</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: </strong><strong>Khu vực lối v&agrave;o v&agrave; tầng trệt (Entrance and Ground floor)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyZkdJIdqordWLxHdWolzvIygLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Tại lối v&agrave;o, s&acirc;n bay c&oacute; hai khu vực ri&ecirc;ng biệt.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyZkdJIdqordWLxHdWolzvIygLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Khu vực b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i chứa khu vực khởi h&agrave;nh, <strong>bao gồm c&aacute;c tiện &iacute;ch an ninh v&agrave; kiểm so&aacute;t hộ chiếu</strong> <em>(featuring security and passport control facilities)</em>, c&ugrave;ng với quầy check-in v&agrave; một qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; trong khu vực khởi h&agrave;nh. Sau khi t&aacute;i ph&aacute;t triển, khu vực n&agrave;y sẽ <strong>c&oacute; th&ecirc;m một khu vực gửi h&agrave;nh l&yacute; mới </strong><em>(gain a new bag drop zone)</em> trong khi vẫn giữ lại qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; v&agrave; c&aacute;c tiện &iacute;ch hiện tại kh&aacute;c.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyZkdJIdqordWLxHdWolzvIygLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ở khu vực b&ecirc;n phải, nơi <strong>xử l&yacute; những chuyến ga đến</strong> <em>(handles arrivals)</em>, c&oacute; c&aacute;c khu vực kiểm so&aacute;t hộ chiếu v&agrave; hải quan. Khu vực n&agrave;y <strong>sẽ được n&acirc;ng cấp với</strong><em> (will be enhanced with)</em> c&aacute;c m&aacute;y ATM mới v&agrave; dịch vụ thu&ecirc; xe.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Khu vực ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n (Upper Portion)</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>,&nbsp; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QyQodgEOhoXShpx5DiHlySGigNK\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Chuyển đến phần ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n của s&acirc;n bay, <strong>hai lối đi song song</strong> <em>(two parallel walkways)</em> hiện tại kết nối đến t&aacute;m cổng l&ecirc;n m&aacute;y bay.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QyQodgEOhoXShpx5DiHlySGigNK\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Trong kế hoạch t&aacute;i ph&aacute;t triển, <strong>cấu h&igrave;nh đơn giản n&agrave;y</strong> <em>(simple configuration)</em> sẽ được chuyển đổi th&agrave;nh <strong>một ga h&agrave;nh kh&aacute;ch h&igrave;nh chữ Y </strong><em>(a Y-shaped terminal)</em><strong> </strong>với c&aacute;c lối đi ph&acirc;n nh&aacute;nh phục vụ 18 cổng.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QyQodgEOhoXShpx5DiHlySGigNK\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Một t&agrave;u tr&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng cũng sẽ được bổ sung để vận chuyển h&agrave;nh kh&aacute;ch khắp nh&agrave; ga được mở rộng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2024,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The diagrams illustrate the current layout of Southwest Airport and its planned redevelopment that will be completed next year.</p>",
            "question_id": 18750,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2025,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, while the basic structure with separate areas for departures and arrivals will be maintained, the airport will be significantly expanded with more gates and additional facilities. The most notable change is the extension of the walkway system to accommodate more than twice the number of gates.</p>",
            "question_id": 18750,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2026,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>At the entrance, the airport has two separate sections. The left section houses departures, featuring security and passport control facilities, along with check-in counters and a caf&eacute; in the departures area. After redevelopment, this section will gain a new bag drop zone while retaining its caf&eacute; and other current facilities. In the right section, which handles arrivals, there are passport control and customs areas. This section will be enhanced with new ATM machines and car hire services.</p>",
            "question_id": 18750,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2027,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Moving to the upper portion of the airport, two parallel walkways currently connect to eight boarding gates. In the redevelopment plan, this simple configuration will be transformed into a Y-shaped terminal with branching walkways serving 18 gates. A sky train will also be added to transport passengers throughout the expanded terminal.</p>",
            "question_id": 18750,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
